+<!-- wp:shortcode -->
+[vs_figure file="ts-differencing-acf.svg" alt="Three panels: a series drifting upward, the same series differenced and flat around a dashed mean, and autocorrelation bars that rise again at lag 12"]
+<!-- /wp:shortcode -->
+
+<!-- wp:paragraph -->
+<p>Reading an ACF plot is a core forecasting skill: a slow decay means "difference me", and a spike at lag 12 means a yearly season.</p>
+<!-- /wp:paragraph -->
